  "summary_en": "European Parliament explainer, in Swedish, on the EU AI Act. It covers the risk-based classification (unacceptable, high, transparency), the ban on certain practices, obligations for generative and general-purpose AI, regulatory sandboxes, and the implementation timeline. Product-safety high-risk AI (cars, medical devices) is mentioned only in passing.",
